OL,3,GNEWSAEnergy bills help 'doesn't go far
OL,4,Aenough'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouseholds in the West Midlands said
OL,7,Fthey want to see the government revisit
OL,8,Fenergy bills in the wake of the Budget
OL,9,F- amid concerns the help being offered
OL,10,Fwon't go far enough.
OL,12,FChancellor John Healey announced a #100
OL,13,F'household energy payment', and a
OL,14,Ffuture plan to remove gas standing
OL,15,Fcharges, as part of a wider package to
OL,16,Faddress the cost of living.
OL,18,FFamilies in the region told the BBC
OL,19,Fthey were "grateful" for the
OL,20,Fassistance, but were concerned about
OL,21,Ftheir finances over the winter.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
